# AccountingLiveView Panel with Auto-Refresh

I'll create a new panel class that auto-refreshes journal entries and the corresponding backend endpoint.

## Backend Endpoint

First, let's add the backend endpoint for getting journal entries:

```csharp
app.AddEndpointWithBearerAuth<string>(
    "GetNJournalEntries",
    (AS, LoginInfo) =>
    {
        List<AccountsJournalEntry> AccJEList;
